abstract: >-
  Notebooks, aggregate result artifacts and the analysis pipeline for
  "Rescue Premiums and Employment Tails: Third-Party Equity Placements in
  Listed Korean Firms". The notebooks rebuild every table and figure from the
  aggregate artifacts with outputs stored, so results can be checked without
  any licensed input.
